  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"284\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"142\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Resourceful Lib 是一個模組開發函式庫，內含由 Resourceful 團隊開發的實用工具與 API。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">撰寫本文時，已有多款模組採用此函式庫，包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Bees</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vitalize</a>，還有更多！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📺 GL 裁切 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📝 具狀態與歷史紀錄的畫面管理器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📠 用於條件判斷、標籤、配方、集合與隨機群組的編解碼器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🎨 色彩 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🌐 跨平台網路通訊</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📲 編解碼配方</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📁 JSON 檔案工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            💾 記憶體資源包與資料包</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🎲 隨機集合／列表</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            ⌛ 排程 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🌎 網頁工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📑 YABN（Yet Another Binary Notation）是一種 JSON 的壓縮二進位格式，可大幅降低 JSON 物件的傳輸體積</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📐 高亮選取 API（自訂選取框，不限於方塊範圍）<br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"362\"></a></p>",
